@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@apiKey = course-demo-key

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?status=active&limit=20

### Create a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"sku":"NS-PEN-04","name":"Studio Marker Set","description":"Synthetic classroom inventory item","price_cents":3200,"stock_quantity":24,"status":"active"}

### Create an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{"customer_id":1,"items":[{"product_id":1,"quantity":2}]}
